title: yocto variables
url:   https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html
tags:  bitbake openembedded oe

## recipe
SRC_URI                         # where the sources come from (git, http, file)  @fetch <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-SRC_URI>
SRCREV                          # git commit to build when SRC_URI is git  @revision <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-SRCREV>
DEPENDS                         # recipes needed at build time  @build-deps <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-DEPENDS>
RDEPENDS:${PN}                  # packages needed at run time on target  @runtime-deps <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-RDEPENDS>
FILES:${PN}                     # files that go into the main package  @package <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-FILES>

## image
IMAGE_INSTALL:append = " PKG"   # add PKG to the image (note the leading space)  @add <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-IMAGE_INSTALL>
MACHINE                         # target board, set in local.conf  @board <https://docs.yoctoproject.org/ref-manual/variables.html#term-MACHINE>

## inspect
bitbake -e RECIPE | grep ^VAR=  # show the final value of VAR for RECIPE  @debug @env
